# The build context is the repository root: the pruner stage in
# apps/conductor/Dockerfile copies the whole tree before `turbo prune` cuts it
# down, so keep everything the build does not need out of the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/data/config
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.log
.git
.github
docs
docker-compose.yml
